      "text": [
        "5898 - وَ سُئِلَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : مَا حَدُّ اَلسَّخَاءِ قَالَ \"تُخْرِجُ مِنْ مَالِكَ اَلْحَقَّ اَلَّذِي أَوْجَبَهُ اَللَّهُ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ عَلَيْكَ فَتَضَعُهُ فِي مَوْضِعِهِ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5898 - Abu Abdullah Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) was asked:\n\"What is the definition of generosity?\"\nImam (as) replied: \"It is to give from your wealth the rightful dues that Allah (swt), the Almighty, has obligated upon you, and to place it in its appropriate place.\""
        ]
      }
